---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';import {href} from '../lib/paths';import {release,releaseView} from '../lib/release';
const view=releaseView(release);const stable=release.stable;
---
<Base title="Download and release information" description={`Check the official RBE WaveLab release state, Windows target, license and installation information. ${view.label}.`} path="download/"><div class="container"><header class="page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">Official distribution</span><h1>A clear release state.<br/>A deliberate download.</h1><p class="lede">An application download appears here only after an approved Stable release and its exact installer have been independently verified.</p></header><div class="release-grid section"><section class="release-card" aria-labelledby="release-title"><span class="status" role="status">{view.label}</span><h2 id="release-title">RBE WaveLab</h2><dl class="data-list"><dt>Release state</dt><dd>{view.label}</dd><dt>Platform</dt><dd>{release.platform}</dd><dt>Version</dt><dd>{stable?stable.version:`${release.candidateVersion} · internal candidate, not a public release`}</dd><dt>Publication date</dt><dd>{stable?stable.publicationDate:'Not published'}</dd><dt>Installer size</dt><dd>{stable?`${stable.bytes.toLocaleString('en-US')} bytes`:'Not published; no size is implied'}</dd><dt>SHA-256</dt><dd>{stable?<code>{stable.sha256}</code>:'No public installer checksum'}</dd><dt>Signature</dt><dd>{stable?stable.signature:'Internal candidate is unsigned'}</dd></dl>{view.canDownload?<a class="button" href={view.downloadURL!} data-installer-download>{view.label} ↓</a>:<div class="callout warning"><strong>{release.notice}</strong><p>{release.knownLimitations}</p></div>}<p><a href={view.canDownload?stable!.notesURL:release.sourceNotesURL}>Read authoritative release notes/status ↗</a></p></section><aside><h2>Before an eventual install</h2><ol class="steps"><li><strong>Use the approved release only</strong><p>Confirm the version and exact GitHub asset. Never substitute an internal RC installer.</p></li><li><strong>Compare the file</strong><p>Check the independent expected size and SHA-256. A matching hash does not establish publisher identity or safety.</p></li><li><strong>Read the terms and warnings</strong><p>Keep Windows protections enabled. An unsigned installer has no Authenticode Verified Publisher.</p></li><li><strong>Preserve your work</strong><p>Back up valuable projects, use a permitted location and retain any error. Do not uninstall shared WebView2 to work around a problem.</p></li></ol></aside></div><div class="grid grid-3 section"><a class="article-card" href={href('requirements/')}><h2>Requirements</h2><p>Windows 11 x64 target and WebView2 dependency.</p></a><a class="article-card" href={href('license/')}><h2>Application license</h2><p>Free V1.x, proprietary source and independent component rights.</p></a><a class="article-card" href={href('support/')}><h2>Need help?</h2><p>Best-effort support and a safe bug-reporting process.</p></a></div></div></Base>
